WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.355
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:07.625 --> 00:09.025
SAY NO TO PIRACY, SUPPORT ORIGINALS

3
01:51.945 --> 01:52.905
Yang Rui.

4
01:53.985 --> 01:55.025
Thanks.

5
01:56.465 --> 01:57.385
I owe you one again.

6
01:57.465 --> 01:59.225
I'll take you out for a nice meal.

7
02:01.345 --> 02:02.345
No need.

8
02:02.425 --> 02:03.785
You're a good girl.

9
02:03.865 --> 02:08.304
And it's not the first time I've seen Lin Long snooping through your files.

10
02:08.385 --> 02:09.505
As your senior, I thought I should tell you.

11
02:09.584 --> 02:10.905
Be more careful with your work from now on.

12
02:31.225 --> 02:32.785
Is Yang Rui into you?

13
02:39.545 --> 02:41.945
Don't just accept his help without giving him anything back.

14
02:42.025 --> 02:44.225
Can…

15
02:44.745 --> 02:46.145
Can you thank Zhao Heng for me?

16
02:53.625 --> 02:55.185
He helped me mostly because of you.

17
02:57.905 --> 02:58.865
You're changing the subject.

18
03:00.305 --> 03:02.665
I'm not thanking him. Thank him yourself.

19
03:02.745 --> 03:03.585
Okay, on to business.

20
03:03.665 --> 03:06.225
How did you know Lin Long would take the bait?

21
03:07.745 --> 03:10.585
After Yang Rui warned me last time, I started paying attention.

22
03:11.185 --> 03:12.025
She used to be my mentor,

23
03:12.105 --> 03:14.705
so we share the same company database account.

24
03:14.785 --> 03:16.825
I checked her browsing history from the past two days

25
03:16.905 --> 03:18.745
and found that most of it

26
03:18.825 --> 03:21.665
was related to C&amp;C Consulting, Ye Xinzhi, and Tianhe Air.

27
03:21.745 --> 03:23.825
And with what Zhao Heng told me,

28
03:23.905 --> 03:24.825
I was even more certain.

29
03:24.905 --> 03:26.865
So I pretended to be on the phone with Ye Xinzhi.

30
03:26.945 --> 03:27.785
And sure enough,

31
03:27.865 --> 03:30.225
-I caught her eavesdropping. -Yes. It's been signed.

32
03:30.305 --> 03:31.145
Yes.

33
03:31.225 --> 03:32.985
This is all thanks to you, Richard.

34
03:34.105 --> 03:34.945
Okay.

35
03:35.625 --> 03:36.905
Send the documents over by courier then.

36
03:36.985 --> 03:38.225
I'll review them right away.

37
03:41.025 --> 03:44.625
So what about the signature that mysteriously disappeared?

38
03:45.665 --> 03:47.545
Fading ink from the stationery store.

39
03:47.625 --> 03:49.625
The writing is clear for the first half hour.

40
03:49.705 --> 03:53.425
But the longer it's exposed to air, the more obvious the oxidation reaction.

41
03:54.705 --> 03:55.545
FIRST COPY-CONFIDENTIAL DOCUMENT ACKNOWLEDGMENT-OF-RECEIPT FORM

42
03:55.625 --> 03:56.465
SIGNEE

43
03:57.625 --> 03:58.745
RECEIVED BY OCTOBER 6, 2025

44
03:59.345 --> 04:00.145
This is impossible.

45
04:00.225 --> 04:02.305
-Impressive. -That's terrifying.

46
04:02.865 --> 04:04.265
I'm never crossing you now.

47
04:08.025 --> 04:11.305
Don't be like that. We helped our friend out together.

48
04:11.985 --> 04:13.665
-Zhao Heng. -Yes.

49
04:13.745 --> 04:15.585
You're a good man.

50
04:16.665 --> 04:20.025
But don't waste your time on me. It's useless. Got it?

51
04:21.105 --> 04:24.425
If you spent that time and energy on some other girl,

52
04:24.505 --> 04:27.865
maybe by this time next year, I'd be giving your kid a red envelope.

53
04:28.705 --> 04:29.825
Kid?

54
04:29.905 --> 04:31.945
You're already thinking about having kids.

55
04:32.025 --> 04:35.065
I was just thinking about some casual flirting.

56
04:38.105 --> 04:40.465
How do you think Sha Sha will handle Lin Long?

57
04:43.945 --> 04:45.185
Probably not much.

58
04:45.265 --> 04:47.185
Labor law, you know.

59
04:47.705 --> 04:49.465
But at least one thing's for sure.

60
04:50.145 --> 04:52.425
I won't be pushed around by her so easily anymore.

61
04:54.025 --> 04:55.665
She set me up.

62
04:57.505 --> 04:59.025
She set me up.

63
05:00.225 --> 05:01.865
She set me up.

64
05:02.785 --> 05:04.025
It was all part of her plan.

65
05:20.105 --> 05:23.665
Weren't her accusations true?

66
05:24.185 --> 05:28.425
If you hadn't been so paranoid, constantly accusing and suppressing her,

67
05:28.505 --> 05:30.745
and if you hadn't walked right into her trap,

68
05:30.825 --> 05:32.985
would things have escalated to this point?

69
05:36.025 --> 05:39.145
You always say Xu Chi is scheming to replace you.

70
05:39.225 --> 05:40.385
But from where I stand,

71
05:40.465 --> 05:41.905
she's way better at playing the game than you are.

72
05:42.625 --> 05:44.225
She held in all her resentment

73
05:44.305 --> 05:47.385
and only let it all out at the crucial moment.

74
05:48.025 --> 05:51.025
She asked me for a resolution, but didn't pressure me into a decision.

75
05:52.145 --> 05:55.265
Lin Long, I don't want to hurt you.

76
05:55.865 --> 05:58.785
But please, with the calmness and thoroughness

77
05:58.865 --> 06:02.065
expected of a qualified consultant, tell me, if you were in my shoes,

78
06:03.065 --> 06:04.545
how would you resolve this?

79
06:06.665 --> 06:07.945
If you want to fire me, just say so.

80
06:08.025 --> 06:09.825
No need to beat around the bush.

81
06:10.545 --> 06:12.025
Of course not!

82
06:12.585 --> 06:15.905
Lin Long. Why are you so sensitive and neurotic?

83
06:17.505 --> 06:19.305
I suggest you take your maternity leave early!

84
06:19.385 --> 06:20.425
That's impossible!

85
06:20.505 --> 06:21.945
My due date is still two months away.

86
06:22.025 --> 06:22.905
I have to work till the end!

87
06:22.985 --> 06:24.785
Look at your condition right now. Are you fit to work?

88
06:24.865 --> 06:26.865
I haven't received a single work report from you lately!

89
06:27.465 --> 06:31.305
Aside from monitoring Xu Chi, have you been involved in any projects?

90
06:31.905 --> 06:33.185
Have you been putting in any effort?

91
06:35.705 --> 06:36.545
Lin Long, listen.

92
06:36.625 --> 06:39.225
Choosing when to take your maternity leave is your right,

93
06:39.305 --> 06:42.345
but assigning what work after your leave is my responsibility.

94
06:48.505 --> 06:50.465
We need to stay in close contact with Bolo

95
06:50.545 --> 06:52.865
during the execution phase of this project.

96
06:52.945 --> 06:53.945
This is a good opportunity.

97
06:54.025 --> 06:56.185
Learn from a few directors.

98
06:56.265 --> 06:57.865
Got it. Let me get that for you.

99
07:00.465 --> 07:01.905
Heng, where is she?

100
07:03.665 --> 07:07.745
Lin's not feeling well. She applied for early maternity leave with HR.

101
07:08.545 --> 07:10.385
Sha Sha had Lu Le take over her projects.

102
07:18.185 --> 07:20.065
I tried everything and couldn't make it happen,

103
07:20.145 --> 07:21.505
but you did.

104
07:22.025 --> 07:23.065
Not bad.

105
07:23.945 --> 07:26.185
Just reaping what others sowed.

106
07:26.265 --> 07:29.385
On the Bolo Culture project, I'm just a grunt.

107
07:29.905 --> 07:31.065
Here's the document you asked for.

108
07:48.905 --> 07:50.705
NO. 92, YONG'AN ROAD

109
07:50.785 --> 07:53.465
UNIT 1

110
08:02.345 --> 08:04.425
Miss Xu, here to see the place again?

111
08:05.225 --> 08:06.265
Yeah.

112
08:06.345 --> 08:08.145
But I can't even afford the down payment right now.

113
08:08.225 --> 08:11.785
The owner of 201 keeps saying the price has dropped too much.

114
08:11.865 --> 08:12.825
Selling now wouldn't be worth it.

115
08:12.905 --> 08:15.065
Maybe by the time you have the down payment ready,

116
08:15.145 --> 08:16.345
he'll be willing to sell.

117
08:17.665 --> 08:19.305
Could you contact the owner?

118
08:19.385 --> 08:21.185
At least let me take a look at the place.

119
08:21.265 --> 08:22.105
I can pay for it.

120
08:22.185 --> 08:24.625
Well… I'll try.

121
08:27.065 --> 08:28.625
Please try your best for me.

122
08:28.705 --> 08:29.665
Let me know if you hear anything.

123
08:29.745 --> 08:30.665
-Okay. -Thanks.

124
08:30.745 --> 08:31.585
Bye.

125
08:54.105 --> 08:54.945
Spotting.

126
08:55.025 --> 08:57.025
Cervix is a bit short too.

127
08:57.105 --> 08:58.585
There's a risk of premature labor.

128
08:59.105 --> 09:00.385
I know you have a busy job,

129
09:00.465 --> 09:03.665
but in this condition, you really should rest more.

130
09:06.865 --> 09:09.145
-But I'm already on maternity leave. -That's good.

131
09:09.225 --> 09:11.305
I'll prescribe a week of progesterone to support the pregnancy.

132
09:13.385 --> 09:16.905
I came today because I wanted you to prescribe something to regulate my mood.

133
09:16.985 --> 09:20.745
A lot of people have been saying I'm emotionally unstable lately.

134
09:21.665 --> 09:24.505
And I feel like I can't control my emotions either.

135
09:24.585 --> 09:27.825
I just feel really anxious.

136
09:27.905 --> 09:30.665
But anti-anxiety medication during pregnancy

137
09:30.745 --> 09:31.585
needs to be used very cautiously.

138
09:32.265 --> 09:36.225
I don't think your condition is severe enough to require medication.

139
09:36.305 --> 09:38.705
I'd recommend talking more with your family.

140
09:38.785 --> 09:40.305
Get plenty of rest.

141
09:53.145 --> 09:54.025
Richard.

142
09:56.025 --> 09:58.025
What couldn't be said over WeChat that you had to come here?

143
10:02.625 --> 10:03.465
It's getting late.

144
10:03.545 --> 10:04.865
-Let's grab dinner together. -No, no.

145
10:05.905 --> 10:08.305
I came here because I didn't want to run into any colleagues.

146
10:13.185 --> 10:14.945
I need to come clean about something.

147
10:17.665 --> 10:21.425
I used you as a decoy to set a trap for Lin Long.

148
10:22.025 --> 10:24.865
She's the supervisor who forced me to drink at Wanghu Pavilion Restaurant.

149
10:26.345 --> 10:28.585
-What really happened? -Someone's out to get me.

150
10:29.825 --> 10:30.945
Get in.

151
10:36.665 --> 10:39.225
Lin Long is really spiraling right now.

152
10:39.305 --> 10:42.825
What if she keeps spreading rumors while she's on leave?

153
10:43.425 --> 10:46.585
You said the consulting circle is small.

154
10:47.105 --> 10:49.705
Could this affect you?

155
10:52.265 --> 10:53.305
That's what you're worried about?

156
10:57.185 --> 10:59.225
You were so tough when you dealt with Lin Long before.

157
10:59.305 --> 11:01.105
Why are you so jumpy all of a sudden?

158
11:02.785 --> 11:05.105
You gave me that nickname "poser".

159
11:06.105 --> 11:09.625
So I guess I'm kind of an eligible bachelor.

160
11:10.385 --> 11:14.225
I've been around plenty of women, married and single.

161
11:14.305 --> 11:15.305
I've had all kinds of rumors made up about me.

162
11:15.905 --> 11:17.465
One more from you?

163
11:17.985 --> 11:18.985
It's not going to cause much of a stir.

164
11:24.985 --> 11:28.265
If Sha Sha hadn't given me that meaningful warning,

165
11:28.345 --> 11:30.905
I wouldn't be here listening to you show off.

166
11:32.505 --> 11:35.225
DON'T LET UNNECESSARY RUMORS HOLD BACK YOUR GROWTH

167
11:36.985 --> 11:40.665
Your boss told you to be careful, and you came to warn me?

168
11:46.105 --> 11:47.625
That night you drank so much.

169
11:47.705 --> 11:49.385
That was with Tianhe Air' senior management, right?

170
11:49.985 --> 11:52.785
My little non-story doesn't even count as juicy gossip,

171
11:52.865 --> 11:53.705
so it's no big deal.

172
11:53.785 --> 11:56.465
But Tianhe Air used to be state-owned.

173
11:56.545 --> 11:58.345
It's the small oversights that bring down whole empires.

174
11:58.945 --> 12:01.945
What if rumors about information leaks or corporate spies start spreading

175
12:02.025 --> 12:03.145
and people actually believe them?

176
12:03.225 --> 12:04.625
It could hurt your project.

177
12:05.145 --> 12:06.425
And then you'll black out again.

178
12:09.305 --> 12:12.345
I landed the Tianhe Air project

179
12:12.425 --> 12:14.825
because of years of deep industry experience

180
12:14.905 --> 12:16.665
and C&amp;C Consulting's unique management model.

181
12:16.745 --> 12:19.425
Not some movie-style trade secret

182
12:19.505 --> 12:22.105
where one stolen USB drive brings down the whole company.

183
12:23.065 --> 12:25.385
And I don't think Sha Sha was warning you.

184
12:25.985 --> 12:27.265
She really sees potential in you.

185
12:27.345 --> 12:28.905
That's why she was giving you advice.

186
12:28.985 --> 12:32.705
After all, women face a lot more trouble in the workplace than men do.

187
12:35.625 --> 12:37.785
-Buckle up. -What for?

188
12:38.585 --> 12:40.025
You got promoted. You have to treat me to dinner, right?

189
12:46.065 --> 12:48.265
Happy to treat you.

190
12:48.345 --> 12:50.465
But don't go overboard.

191
12:50.545 --> 12:51.945
This place doesn't look cheap.

192
12:52.025 --> 12:53.185
-Come on. -Let's toast.

193
12:53.865 --> 12:54.905
Come on.

194
13:00.465 --> 13:02.545
Hey, would you…?

195
13:03.145 --> 13:04.425
I chose this place on purpose.

196
13:04.505 --> 13:06.305
People from the Da'ai Foundation Consulting Industry Chapter

197
13:06.385 --> 13:07.985
have dinner here every month.

198
13:09.465 --> 13:10.985
Wh-What are you doing?

199
13:11.065 --> 13:12.145
You're worried about rumors, right?

200
13:12.225 --> 13:13.545
Let me teach you something.

201
13:14.145 --> 13:16.785
The best way to manage a potential crisis isn't to avoid it.

202
13:16.865 --> 13:19.465
It's to take the initiative and give the rumors no place to land.

203
13:20.025 --> 13:21.025
Let's go.

204
13:22.225 --> 13:23.265
Du!

205
13:25.585 --> 13:27.305
You're all here. What a coincidence.

206
13:27.985 --> 13:28.825
Uh…

207
13:31.025 --> 13:31.905
Wh… Who's this?

208
13:32.945 --> 13:34.305
This is our little junior, Xu Chi.

209
13:35.265 --> 13:39.225
Her family asked me to look out for her, but she ended up at Maxmise on her own.

210
13:40.465 --> 13:42.065
Let me introduce you. This is Du.

211
13:42.665 --> 13:44.105
He used to be at Boen. Now he's out on his own.

212
13:45.105 --> 13:46.145
Hello, Du.

213
13:46.865 --> 13:48.065
I don't need to introduce Sha Sha, do I?

214
13:49.065 --> 13:51.025
-Ms. Sha. -Sha Sha.

215
13:51.105 --> 13:52.505
This girl has a really stubborn personality.

216
13:52.585 --> 13:54.345
Keep her in line at the office.

217
13:55.585 --> 13:56.785
Xinzhi, why are you being so formal with me?

218
13:57.505 --> 13:59.145
She's already key to my team now.

219
13:59.825 --> 14:01.145
She just came in through campus recruiting,

220
14:01.225 --> 14:02.825
and she's already an SBA.

221
14:04.425 --> 14:05.585
Du.

222
14:05.665 --> 14:06.785
Give us an introduction.

223
14:07.625 --> 14:10.185
Oh, we're from the Da'ai Foundation Consulting Chapter.

224
14:10.265 --> 14:11.385
Let's go around.

225
14:11.465 --> 14:15.265
Come on. This is Wang Teng from Tengfei Consulting.

226
14:15.345 --> 14:17.225
Hello. I'm Wang Teng from Tengfei Consulting.

227
14:17.305 --> 14:18.585
-Hello. I'm Xu Chi. -Just call me Wang.

228
14:18.665 --> 14:20.625
-Mr. Wang. -This is Wu.

229
14:21.185 --> 14:22.425
Wu Ming from Haowang Consulting.

230
14:22.505 --> 14:23.865
-Hello. -Wang is actually quite young.

231
14:23.945 --> 14:25.145
He just looks older than his age.

232
14:25.225 --> 14:26.545
-Not at all. -You really don't know how to talk.

233
14:34.585 --> 14:35.865
Thank you.

234
14:36.745 --> 14:39.105
What, you're mad at me?

235
14:39.945 --> 14:42.305
Upset that I turned a perfectly decent young professional

236
14:42.385 --> 14:43.665
into a nepotism hire?

237
14:45.585 --> 14:46.945
A little.

238
14:47.785 --> 14:50.265
But I don't really have the right to be precious about it.

239
14:50.345 --> 14:52.185
Your method really did work.

240
14:52.265 --> 14:56.505
Now that I'm your junior, no one will misunderstand,

241
14:56.585 --> 14:58.585
and my path forward is clearer.

242
15:00.665 --> 15:02.345
There's nothing wrong with being my junior.

243
15:02.865 --> 15:04.545
Even Sha Sha calls me senior.

244
15:05.145 --> 15:07.465
I didn't do much. Just said a few words.

245
15:07.545 --> 15:10.145
At most, it'll keep Sha Sha from being wary of you for pushing Lin Long out.

246
15:11.385 --> 15:15.385
Your friend Bu Tianna is the one with the real connections.

247
15:16.545 --> 15:18.985
Bu Tianna doesn't rely entirely on connections.

248
15:19.065 --> 15:20.705
She works hard on her own too.

249
15:21.705 --> 15:24.785
You need to let go of that student mentality.

250
15:25.545 --> 15:29.745
I know. That's why I keep telling her it's not shameful to use her network.

251
15:31.105 --> 15:32.945
That's exactly what I mean by student mentality.

252
15:33.505 --> 15:34.865
What do you mean by "not shameful"?

253
15:34.945 --> 15:37.025
What do you mean by "she doesn't rely entirely on connections"?

254
15:37.665 --> 15:42.345
Those words imply that you're okay with accepting help in your career,

255
15:42.425 --> 15:44.305
but deep down, you look down on it.

256
15:44.385 --> 15:46.225
Miss, times have changed.

257
15:46.305 --> 15:48.425
Consulting isn't some glamorous industry.

258
15:48.505 --> 15:50.305
It's just about making money for companies.

259
15:50.385 --> 15:54.185
If you can't understand society and capital faster than others,

260
15:54.705 --> 15:55.785
you won't last long in this job.

261
15:57.425 --> 16:00.985
Is refusing help also a form of student mentality?

262
16:01.065 --> 16:02.425
You caught my subtext?

263
16:05.105 --> 16:08.465
Someone like me, who fought all the way up,

264
16:09.065 --> 16:10.705
has never gotten lucky.

265
16:10.785 --> 16:12.385
But you've been too good to me.

266
16:12.465 --> 16:15.585
You only interviewed me once, and you've given me so much guidance.

267
16:16.105 --> 16:17.145
I…

268
16:17.225 --> 16:18.625
Don't get too excited.

269
16:18.705 --> 16:20.865
Sometimes free things are the most expensive.

270
16:22.665 --> 16:23.865
Now I'm a partner.

271
16:24.465 --> 16:25.785
I'll need one or two trusted people.

272
16:26.305 --> 16:28.585
Not company people. Mine personally.

273
16:29.305 --> 16:32.025
So I can have them handle things I can't do myself,

274
16:32.105 --> 16:35.625
without leaking any trade secrets.

275
16:36.145 --> 16:38.425
And you could be that person.

276
16:39.345 --> 16:40.785
That's why I've been paving the way for you a bit.

277
16:40.865 --> 16:44.905
But whether it works out or not depends on you.

278
16:49.985 --> 16:51.425
Yes, my lord.

279
16:52.825 --> 16:54.585
You didn't even think it over before saying yes?

280
16:54.665 --> 16:56.385
My instincts already made the call.

281
16:56.465 --> 16:58.105
Ambition has always driven me forward.

282
16:58.785 --> 17:01.145
Working for a partner of C&amp;C Consulting for a year

283
17:01.225 --> 17:03.985
will teach me more than three years of figuring things out on my own.

284
17:04.985 --> 17:06.464
The sooner I become a consultant,

285
17:06.545 --> 17:09.265
the closer I get to my dream and my mom's old apartment.

286
17:09.345 --> 17:10.704
Why wouldn't I seize such a good opportunity?

287
17:11.424 --> 17:13.424
So, what do you need me to do?

288
17:14.825 --> 17:16.625
First, finish what's on your plate.

289
17:16.704 --> 17:18.985
Let me see that you have the ability to complete a whole project on your own.

290
17:19.944 --> 17:21.224
Send me your personal email.

291
17:21.305 --> 17:23.065
I have some public materials.

292
17:23.145 --> 17:24.184
Go through them when you have time.

293
17:29.985 --> 17:31.825
What, not enough work?

294
17:31.905 --> 17:33.665
You'll cry from how exhausted you'll be.

295
17:42.465 --> 17:46.585
I don't think your condition is severe enough to require medication.

296
17:46.665 --> 17:49.265
I'd recommend talking more with your family.

297
17:49.345 --> 17:50.385
Get plenty of rest.

298
18:09.065 --> 18:10.385
You're back.

299
18:11.745 --> 18:12.585
So you're home.

300
18:12.665 --> 18:14.945
I messaged you saying I made dinner and was waiting for you.

301
18:15.025 --> 18:16.185
Didn't you see it?

302
18:16.265 --> 18:18.025
I've been busy all day. Didn't check my phone.

303
18:18.105 --> 18:19.185
I already ate.

304
18:19.825 --> 18:22.145
I haven't eaten yet. Eat with me.

305
18:26.345 --> 18:28.425
Zhiwen, I shouldn't have lost my temper

306
18:28.505 --> 18:31.145
about your dad buying the apartment last time.

307
18:31.225 --> 18:33.185
But you know I've been emotionally unstable during pregnancy.

308
18:33.265 --> 18:34.985
But I won't do that anymore.

309
18:35.065 --> 18:37.665
I've already applied for early maternity leave.

310
18:37.745 --> 18:38.985
I'm coming home to rest now.

311
18:39.065 --> 18:40.425
You won't have to order takeout anymore.

312
18:40.505 --> 18:42.185
Just come home early after work.

313
18:42.265 --> 18:43.785
I'll make you dinner.

314
18:43.865 --> 18:45.065
Alright?

315
18:50.145 --> 18:52.145
Here. Try this.

316
18:52.225 --> 18:53.225
It's your favorite.

317
18:53.305 --> 18:54.905
I made it just for you.

318
19:00.705 --> 19:01.985
Zhiwen, just have a taste.

319
19:02.065 --> 19:03.465
The food's getting cold.

320
19:03.545 --> 19:06.985
I'm not coming home late because of overtime.

321
19:07.065 --> 19:08.305
I've been at the gym.

322
19:08.945 --> 19:12.225
I haven't touched carbs or greasy food for almost a month now.

323
19:13.025 --> 19:15.545
Do you even listen to anything I say?

324
19:15.625 --> 19:18.825
Well, you don't pay attention to my stuff either.

325
19:19.425 --> 19:22.905
The doctor called you today about my risk of premature labor, right?

326
19:23.945 --> 19:25.145
I was there listening.

327
19:25.225 --> 19:27.465
I had her hang up because I didn't want you to worry.

328
19:27.545 --> 19:31.545
Have you said one caring thing to me since you walked in?

329
19:31.625 --> 19:33.825
I knew you were setting this up.

330
19:34.425 --> 19:37.865
You just want to play the sick card and force me to bow down to you.

331
19:38.745 --> 19:40.025
Who's forcing you?

332
19:40.545 --> 19:41.665
I am apologizing to you.

333
19:42.265 --> 19:43.945
I made this whole table of food.

334
19:44.025 --> 19:45.425
I already gave in first.

335
19:45.505 --> 19:46.585
What more do you want from me?

336
19:46.665 --> 19:47.665
Come on.

337
19:48.865 --> 19:52.705
You just wanted to show off how hardworking and virtuous you are.

338
19:52.785 --> 19:55.185
Like I'm forcing a pregnant woman to do housework.

339
19:55.265 --> 19:56.985
Can't we hire a cleaner?

340
19:57.065 --> 19:58.425
Can't we order takeout?

341
19:59.305 --> 20:00.505
I just want to know this.

342
20:00.585 --> 20:03.665
Why do you always have to look down on me from your moral high ground?

343
20:04.745 --> 20:06.865
Jiang Zhiwen, have some conscience, will you?

344
20:08.265 --> 20:09.385
Look at my condition right now.

345
20:09.985 --> 20:10.985
Even if you're just pretending,

346
20:11.065 --> 20:13.865
can you at least act like you care about me?

347
20:15.345 --> 20:17.185
I really don't feel well right now.

348
20:17.265 --> 20:18.505
My body feels awful.

349
20:18.585 --> 20:20.185
Work isn't going well either.

350
20:20.265 --> 20:22.265
Knowing me, do you think I'd be home

351
20:22.345 --> 20:24.665
on maternity leave this early if I had a choice?

352
20:28.345 --> 20:29.945
From now on, do whatever you want.

353
20:30.025 --> 20:31.425
Just don't drag me into it.

354
20:32.025 --> 20:34.905
When your due date comes, I'll take you to the hospital.

355
20:35.825 --> 20:37.065
After that, we go our separate ways.

356
20:39.265 --> 20:40.105
Jiang Zhiwen, don't leave!

357
20:40.185 --> 20:41.225
Come back here and explain yourself!

358
20:41.865 --> 20:44.825
Are you trying to force me into divorce with this cold treatment?

359
20:44.905 --> 20:46.665
Are you crazy?

360
20:46.745 --> 20:47.585
Who said anything about divorce?

361
20:48.745 --> 20:50.785
I just can't stand listening to you.

362
20:50.865 --> 20:52.665
Just have the baby safely.

363
20:52.745 --> 20:54.545
We'll still have that bond as husband and wife.

364
20:55.185 --> 20:57.505
Don't keep using divorce as a weapon.

365
20:57.585 --> 20:59.425
Otherwise, you'll end up with nothing!

366
21:17.385 --> 21:18.665
Bye, my lord.

367
21:24.145 --> 21:25.585
Why didn't you drive her home?

368
21:26.225 --> 21:27.465
Her place is really close to mine.

369
21:27.545 --> 21:29.585
-Why would I? -Close?

370
21:29.665 --> 21:31.305
Then you should definitely drive her home.

371
21:31.385 --> 21:32.785
You're failing as an elder.

372
21:32.865 --> 21:33.985
I told her I have things to do later.

373
21:34.785 --> 21:36.465
Wait, what's going on with you two?

374
21:36.545 --> 21:38.105
Now you're drawing a line?

375
21:38.185 --> 21:40.345
You were protecting her so much when people were around.

376
21:40.425 --> 21:42.465
You two couldn't stop talking during dinner.

377
21:42.545 --> 21:43.625
She's different from the others.

378
21:45.785 --> 21:47.065
Different how?

379
21:47.145 --> 21:48.145
Don't give me that smirk.

380
21:48.225 --> 21:49.785
I see her as half a protege.

381
21:49.865 --> 21:52.625
Management consulting is basically partners

382
21:52.705 --> 21:54.145
leading their own teams into the field.

383
21:54.225 --> 21:55.705
I need my own trusted people.

384
21:56.225 --> 21:57.385
The ones before weren't cutting it.

385
21:57.465 --> 21:59.785
Finally found someone with both emotional intelligence and ability.

386
21:59.865 --> 22:01.305
Of course, I'm going to lock her down.

387
22:01.865 --> 22:06.025
So are you going to bring her into your Monte Cristo Plan?

388
22:06.105 --> 22:08.105
Not yet. Let's develop her first.

389
22:08.185 --> 22:09.505
We'll see if she's up to it.

390
22:16.425 --> 22:19.545
Now I'm a partner, I'll need one or two trusted people.

391
22:19.625 --> 22:21.905
Not company people. Mine personally.

392
22:21.985 --> 22:24.185
And you could be that person.

393
22:24.265 --> 22:27.945
But whether it works out or not depends on you.

394
22:28.545 --> 22:30.425
Working for a partner of C&amp;C Consulting for a year

395
22:31.025 --> 22:33.545
will teach me more than three years of figuring things out on my own.

396
22:33.625 --> 22:35.385
The sooner I become a consultant,

397
22:35.465 --> 22:38.345
the closer I get to my dream and my mom's old apartment.

398
22:41.025 --> 22:45.305
I've been trying hard to become a qualified consultant as soon as I can.

399
22:45.385 --> 22:47.985
Not just for the money and my mom's old apartment.

400
22:48.665 --> 22:51.545
I also hope that one day,

401
22:52.185 --> 22:55.585
I can be as strong and smart as you,

402
22:55.665 --> 22:58.505
stay calm, and handle anything with ease.

403
23:11.905 --> 23:12.865
Hello?

404
23:13.385 --> 23:15.905
I'm almost done with the Ande Energy contract.

405
23:15.985 --> 23:18.825
But Mr. Pi is planning to add Lu Le to the project.

406
23:19.585 --> 23:21.585
Lu Le is close with Lin Long.

407
23:22.185 --> 23:26.985
Do you think she'll stir up trouble on my project because she resents you?

408
23:27.065 --> 23:30.185
Should I have Ande Energy reject her?

409
23:30.265 --> 23:31.785
Why bother? First,

410
23:31.865 --> 23:34.345
you need to trust that Maxmise consultants are professional enough.

411
23:34.425 --> 23:37.905
Second, she's been helping Lin Long all this time

412
23:37.985 --> 23:40.465
and still couldn't touch me. Right?

413
23:41.145 --> 23:42.905
Third, even if she tries something,

414
23:42.985 --> 23:45.985
responding after she makes her move puts you in a higher position.

415
23:46.585 --> 23:47.505
That's true.

416
23:48.025 --> 23:49.465
One of the reasons I like you

417
23:49.545 --> 23:52.865
is that communication with you is so efficient.

418
23:53.385 --> 23:54.585
-Bye. -Hold on.

419
23:55.705 --> 23:59.825
I actually have something I want your advice on.

420
24:01.705 --> 24:03.465
If, just if,

421
24:04.065 --> 24:06.985
a really tempting opportunity comes your way,

422
24:07.065 --> 24:12.145
and you've already said yes, but afterwards, you feel it's risky,

423
24:13.345 --> 24:15.265
-would you regret it? -No.

424
24:15.345 --> 24:17.905
Because my instincts already made the call.

425
24:18.505 --> 24:22.625
And honestly, you don't get many lucky breaks in life.

426
24:22.705 --> 24:23.825
Miss one and it's gone.

427
24:23.905 --> 24:25.785
So what if there's risk?

428
24:26.385 --> 24:28.345
We're still young. We can afford to lose.

429
24:29.025 --> 24:29.865
Yeah.

430
24:31.385 --> 24:33.745
-Thanks. -Bye.

431
24:56.945 --> 24:57.785
BOLO CULTURE, MAXMISE CONSULTING

432
24:58.705 --> 24:59.625
Thanks.

433
24:59.705 --> 25:01.545
-Great! -Pleasure working with you.

434
25:09.105 --> 25:11.585
I landed this project with Bolo Culture.

435
25:11.665 --> 25:13.465
But that's just the first step.

436
25:13.545 --> 25:16.265
I will become who you are now.

437
25:16.345 --> 25:17.345
I definitely will.

438
25:29.305 --> 25:30.745
-Dad! Mom! -Tianna.

439
25:34.065 --> 25:35.585
Watch where you're going!

440
25:36.185 --> 25:37.105
What's wrong?

441
25:37.865 --> 25:38.785
What's wrong, Nana?

442
25:38.865 --> 25:40.465
You love Zhang's crispy pastries.

443
25:40.545 --> 25:42.185
I drove out of my way to buy them,

444
25:42.265 --> 25:43.825
and this little brat knocked them all over.

445
25:43.905 --> 25:45.185
What little brat?

446
25:45.265 --> 25:46.505
That's your brother.

447
25:47.345 --> 25:48.945
Yeah! I'm not a brat!

448
25:49.025 --> 25:50.905
Honestly. Always causing trouble when you're home.

449
25:50.985 --> 25:52.945
Do you even act like an older sister?

450
25:53.545 --> 25:55.785
Dad, I… I just gave him a little talking-to.

451
25:55.865 --> 25:57.265
I didn't even hit him.

452
25:57.345 --> 25:58.265
How is that causing trouble?

453
25:58.865 --> 26:00.585
Why are you picking on our girl?

454
26:01.185 --> 26:02.985
You haven't seen Nana in almost a month.

455
26:03.865 --> 26:05.705
Have a good chat with her.

456
26:05.785 --> 26:06.625
Okay.

457
26:15.505 --> 26:16.905
-No, I don't want it! -Xiaojie.

458
26:26.865 --> 26:29.385
Nana. Here, have some food. Eat up.

459
26:29.465 --> 26:30.865
You haven't been home in a while.

460
26:30.945 --> 26:32.785
Have some food. It's your favorite.

461
26:32.865 --> 26:33.705
Dig in.

462
26:34.785 --> 26:36.465
It's the weekend tomorrow.

463
26:37.025 --> 26:38.665
Go play some ball with your dad.

464
26:38.745 --> 26:40.665
Mr. Huang will be there too.

465
26:41.185 --> 26:43.865
His son is a year older than you.

466
26:43.945 --> 26:45.705
He's a VP at an investment bank.

467
26:46.585 --> 26:48.265
You young people should connect more.

468
26:48.345 --> 26:52.385
Who knows, maybe his firm could invest in yours.

469
26:54.105 --> 26:56.225
If you want me to go on a blind date, just say so.

470
26:56.305 --> 26:58.025
Don't beat around the bush.

471
26:58.865 --> 27:02.585
Besides, Maxmise is a globally recognized consulting firm.

472
27:02.665 --> 27:03.985
We don't need investment.

473
27:04.545 --> 27:07.225
And VPs are a dime a dozen at investment banks.

474
27:07.305 --> 27:08.705
CEOs are everywhere.

475
27:08.785 --> 27:10.465
Whether he's young and successful is still up in the air.

476
27:11.905 --> 27:13.785
How dare you talk to your mother like that?

477
27:15.905 --> 27:16.945
You…

478
27:17.545 --> 27:19.105
You're not even as polite as Jie.

479
27:19.185 --> 27:20.505
Yeah! So rude!

480
27:20.585 --> 27:22.465
Bad Tianna!

481
27:22.545 --> 27:25.105
-Eat up. Eat. -Bad Tianna!

482
27:30.465 --> 27:33.025
Anyway, you're coming with me to see Mr. Huang tomorrow.

483
27:33.625 --> 27:35.825
He's watched you grow up.

484
27:35.905 --> 27:38.385
He wants to see you, and you're making excuses.

485
27:38.905 --> 27:40.145
What kind of behavior is that?

486
27:41.625 --> 27:42.825
Who's the one behaving badly?

487
27:43.425 --> 27:45.905
Bu Tianjie is young, and he's already cursing at me.

488
27:45.985 --> 27:47.385
Why aren't you doing anything about it?

489
27:47.465 --> 27:49.785
I make a few casual remarks, and you scold me.

490
27:49.865 --> 27:51.225
Fine, I'll be direct.

491
27:51.305 --> 27:53.065
I don't even know Mr. Huang,

492
27:53.145 --> 27:54.785
and I'm not at the age where I'm desperate to get married.

493
27:54.865 --> 27:56.025
I'm not going on a blind date.

494
27:56.105 --> 27:57.105
Alright, alright. Stop talking.

495
27:57.185 --> 27:58.905
If you don't want to go, don't go.

496
27:58.985 --> 28:00.385
Tell us about your work.

497
28:00.465 --> 28:02.865
Let your dad give you some advice.

498
28:07.225 --> 28:08.225
Yeah, yeah.

499
28:08.305 --> 28:09.505
Go ahead.

500
28:09.585 --> 28:12.385
Your mom said you're about to sign a contract.

501
28:14.985 --> 28:17.825
It's a strategic cooperation with Ande Energy.

502
28:17.905 --> 28:19.745
That project will probably last a whole year.

503
28:20.505 --> 28:21.985
Ande Energy?

504
28:22.065 --> 28:24.825
Isn't that the company Yan Hongjun just acquired?

505
28:26.105 --> 28:29.625
That kid sure knows how to do me a favor.

506
28:29.705 --> 28:33.545
I heard Hongjun's son made it into one of the Red Circle law firms.

507
28:33.625 --> 28:35.825
I heard that kid speaks great French.

508
28:35.905 --> 28:36.825
Right?

509
28:37.425 --> 28:38.625
Pretty impressive.

510
28:40.385 --> 28:43.745
Should we sign Jie up for a foreign language class?

511
28:43.825 --> 28:45.705
I think he has great language skills.

512
28:46.305 --> 28:48.345
Maybe French and German. Spanish too.

513
28:48.985 --> 28:50.545
Can't let him fall behind already.

514
28:50.625 --> 28:52.545
All the neighbor kids are taking classes.

515
28:53.065 --> 28:53.905
Should we maybe…?

516
28:54.625 --> 28:56.385
Dad, Mom. Work just called me.

517
28:56.465 --> 28:57.585
I need to go back to the office.

518
28:57.665 --> 28:58.905
You two enjoy your meal.

519
29:21.865 --> 29:22.905
Hello?

520
29:22.985 --> 29:23.905
Chi.

521
29:25.105 --> 29:26.865
Come drink with me right now.

522
29:26.945 --> 29:27.825
You…

523
29:31.705 --> 29:32.865
I'll go with you.

524
29:34.025 --> 29:35.505
No need.

525
29:35.585 --> 29:36.425
You sure?

526
29:36.505 --> 29:38.705
What if she gets drunk and starts acting crazy?

527
29:38.785 --> 29:40.505
Can you handle it alone?

528
29:42.745 --> 29:43.585
Let's go.

529
29:53.825 --> 29:54.745
Hey beautiful.

530
29:54.825 --> 29:56.105
Want a drink?

531
30:02.185 --> 30:03.585
-Still want one? -Ow, ow.

532
30:06.105 --> 30:06.945
Scram.

533
30:40.945 --> 30:42.345
Why aren't you asking me why?

534
30:42.945 --> 30:44.905
You'll tell me when you're ready.

535
30:51.265 --> 30:52.585
I'm telling you,

536
30:53.425 --> 30:55.825
I really wanted to get drunk tonight.

537
30:56.505 --> 31:01.585
But there's this voice in my head reminding me that

538
31:02.625 --> 31:06.065
I haven't finished the recommendations for the Ande Energy project.

539
31:06.745 --> 31:09.745
What if I wake up with a hangover tomorrow?

540
31:09.825 --> 31:10.665
What do I do?

541
31:10.745 --> 31:12.425
Worry about tomorrow when it comes.

542
31:13.025 --> 31:14.065
I'll drink with you.

543
31:14.585 --> 31:15.665
I brought a driver.

544
31:30.705 --> 31:31.545
Easy.

545
31:49.385 --> 31:50.985
Chi.

546
31:52.305 --> 31:53.705
You're so good to me.

547
31:55.425 --> 31:57.505
Of course I am.

548
31:58.025 --> 32:00.985
I'm pretty, kind-hearted and easy to push over.

549
32:01.065 --> 32:02.745
I just don't have your figure.

550
32:07.305 --> 32:09.105
Let me ask you something.

551
32:09.185 --> 32:12.265
Do you really not remember that time a few years ago

552
32:12.345 --> 32:15.825
at Anyang Road subway station when you helped someone?

553
32:16.345 --> 32:17.465
Hel…

554
32:17.545 --> 32:18.385
FIVE YEARS AGO

555
32:18.465 --> 32:19.905
Where are you?

556
32:19.985 --> 32:21.505
Reply to me.

557
32:22.025 --> 32:24.185
I haven't eaten in over 12 hours.

558
32:29.905 --> 32:31.705
What's wrong? Are you okay?

559
32:32.385 --> 32:34.185
I think I have low blood sugar.

560
32:34.705 --> 32:35.625
Feeling a bit dizzy.

561
32:36.585 --> 32:37.905
I just bought some orange juice.

562
32:37.985 --> 32:38.825
Do you want some?

563
32:38.905 --> 32:40.105
Have a little.

564
32:45.705 --> 32:48.545
I also have bread and crackers.

565
32:48.625 --> 32:49.545
Do you want some?

566
32:51.465 --> 32:52.785
Easy, easy.

567
32:53.825 --> 32:55.265
Slow down. Take your time.

568
32:59.505 --> 33:00.345
Want some?

569
33:05.345 --> 33:06.305
Thanks.

570
33:10.185 --> 33:13.345
You… You're that girl who passed out?

571
33:13.425 --> 33:15.345
The one with low blood sugar?

572
33:18.185 --> 33:19.745
You're so slow.

573
33:19.825 --> 33:22.145
Why did it take you this long to figure it out?

574
33:22.705 --> 33:24.385
Let me tell you something, Chi.

575
33:24.465 --> 33:26.505
You saved me that day.

576
33:26.585 --> 33:30.745
I'm going to be really, really good to you from now on.

577
33:36.665 --> 33:38.385
I'm in applied statistics.

578
33:39.625 --> 33:40.905
Not answering directly?

579
33:40.985 --> 33:43.425
Guess your school and name aren't worth mentioning.

580
33:43.505 --> 33:45.545
With this job market,

581
33:45.625 --> 33:48.465
even Maxmise cut 10% of their senior staff.

582
33:48.545 --> 33:49.825
Since we're bound to compete,

583
33:50.465 --> 33:52.305
why bother pretending to be all friendly?

584
33:52.385 --> 33:54.945
You're pretty confident in your abilities, huh?

585
33:57.905 --> 34:00.105
MAXMISE, SHAPING THE FUTURE TOGETHER

586
34:08.465 --> 34:09.505
Let me ask you.

587
34:09.585 --> 34:12.304
Do you know why I was there that day?

588
34:13.824 --> 34:15.185
How would I know?

589
34:16.385 --> 34:17.545
I'll tell you.

590
34:20.225 --> 34:22.025
What does this consent form mean?

591
34:22.705 --> 34:24.105
You're making my mom risk having a baby at her age?

592
34:24.705 --> 34:26.304
Is having a son really that important?

593
34:30.784 --> 34:31.625
-Na! -Tianna!

594
34:31.705 --> 34:34.185
Do you really have to have a son to be the heir?

595
34:35.985 --> 34:37.744
I'm already 20 years old.

596
34:38.625 --> 34:41.865
My parents had a boy behind my back.

597
34:42.665 --> 34:44.425
Why?

598
34:46.665 --> 34:48.465
Am I not their beloved daughter?

599
34:49.625 --> 34:50.705
Am I?

600
34:52.025 --> 34:52.985
No, I'm not.

601
34:53.784 --> 34:56.145
All they care about is their son.

602
34:56.225 --> 34:57.945
What little brat?

603
34:58.025 --> 34:59.265
That's your brother.

604
34:59.985 --> 35:01.505
Honestly. Always causing trouble when you're home.

605
35:02.105 --> 35:03.225
Do you act like an older sister?

606
35:04.305 --> 35:07.985
I have been pouring everything

607
35:08.065 --> 35:10.505
into the Ande Energy project, day and night,

608
35:11.185 --> 35:13.625
just to prove to him

609
35:13.705 --> 35:15.705
that I'm capable of taking over his business.

610
35:15.785 --> 35:16.865
But he…

611
35:21.425 --> 35:22.625
He doesn't care at all.

612
35:22.705 --> 35:23.865
Ande Energy?

613
35:24.905 --> 35:27.625
Isn't that the company Yan Hongjun just acquired?

614
35:28.745 --> 35:31.985
That kid sure knows how to do me a favor.

615
35:32.905 --> 35:34.785
He doesn't care about me at all.

616
35:42.545 --> 35:44.465
-On their behalf, I'll apolo-- -Shut up!

617
35:45.425 --> 35:48.705
Listen, I know exactly what's on your mind.

618
35:49.545 --> 35:50.785
You're thinking

619
35:50.865 --> 35:54.385
that even if most of the Bu family money goes to my brother,

620
35:54.465 --> 35:56.345
some of it will still come to me, right?

621
35:56.985 --> 35:58.105
You're thinking that money

622
35:58.185 --> 36:01.345
would be enough to turn your whole family's fortunes around, aren't you?

623
36:02.145 --> 36:03.265
I'm sorry.

624
36:03.945 --> 36:04.905
You're wrong.

625
36:04.985 --> 36:06.105
I'm not that kind of person.

626
36:06.185 --> 36:07.905
I don't have that much value to offer.

627
36:07.985 --> 36:08.905
So wake up!

628
36:09.945 --> 36:10.905
I don't need to wake up.

629
36:10.985 --> 36:14.505
Because how much value you have is for me to decide, not you--

630
36:19.905 --> 36:21.145
You awake?

631
36:24.665 --> 36:25.705
Okay.

632
36:25.785 --> 36:26.905
Here.

633
36:26.985 --> 36:28.425
Pour it on this jacket too.

634
36:28.505 --> 36:31.385
Knowing you, you'll buy me a new one anyway.

635
36:31.465 --> 36:32.425
I could use a new one.

636
36:33.785 --> 36:35.225
Why are you so guarded?

637
36:36.345 --> 36:38.505
You really think everyone is after your dad's money?

638
36:39.145 --> 36:44.585
You are pretty and capable.

639
36:44.665 --> 36:46.465
Can't I just be drawn to your personality?

640
36:50.905 --> 36:52.705
-Here. -Wake up.

641
36:52.785 --> 36:54.545
Alright, alright. I'm waking up.

642
36:55.145 --> 36:56.905
-Here. -Do you know where she lives?

643
36:56.985 --> 36:58.265
I've sent her something by courier before.

644
36:58.345 --> 37:01.305
-Just head to Bairui Apartments. -Okay.

645
37:04.985 --> 37:08.425
Great. I was thinking about getting you two a hotel room.

646
37:08.945 --> 37:10.505
So you've helped her before.

647
37:10.585 --> 37:12.265
No wonder she only likes you.

648
37:12.345 --> 37:14.585
Do you really like her?

649
37:15.505 --> 37:17.265
Who wouldn't like something beautiful?

650
37:18.865 --> 37:20.425
What you do from now on is not my business.

651
37:20.505 --> 37:23.065
But don't you dare hurt her.

652
37:23.145 --> 37:23.985
Otherwise…

653
37:24.065 --> 37:26.025
Otherwise, I'll end up like Lin Long.

654
37:26.665 --> 37:28.025
That's what you wanted to say, right?

655
37:28.905 --> 37:30.545
I am indeed a scheming guy.

656
37:30.625 --> 37:32.745
But I'm a different kind of scheming guy.

657
37:33.665 --> 37:36.545
I don't have all those messy bad habits.

658
37:37.225 --> 37:38.745
Whatever our relationship becomes,

659
37:38.825 --> 37:41.505
at least for now, I'm a decent male colleague, right?

660
37:43.545 --> 37:44.625
Don't look at me like that.

661
37:44.705 --> 37:45.825
It's creepy.

662
37:46.945 --> 37:48.225
Alright. Get in.

663
38:02.745 --> 38:03.585
Easy.

664
38:03.665 --> 38:04.625
I'm not drunk.

665
38:04.705 --> 38:06.185
-Can you make it up on your own? -Don't…

666
38:06.265 --> 38:07.105
Of course I can.

667
38:07.185 --> 38:08.305
Okay.

668
38:08.385 --> 38:13.305
Remember, no matter how bad things get, you only get one night to indulge.

669
38:13.385 --> 38:15.945
Because the sadness is temporary.

670
38:16.025 --> 38:17.505
Your career is forever. Right?

671
38:18.625 --> 38:21.505
Fine. Next time you're upset,

672
38:21.585 --> 38:22.705
I'll comfort you the same way.

673
38:28.785 --> 38:30.305
What are you dodging for?

674
38:30.385 --> 38:31.505
I won't eat you alive.

675
38:31.585 --> 38:35.305
Remember, I'm only paying for dry cleaning on this jacket.

676
38:35.985 --> 38:37.665
Forget the dry cleaning.

677
38:37.745 --> 38:39.305
Just have a meal with me.

678
38:41.985 --> 38:43.225
In your dreams.

679
38:44.545 --> 38:45.785
Bye.

680
38:45.865 --> 38:46.945
Take care.

681
38:50.785 --> 38:52.385
You two…

682
38:56.225 --> 38:57.945
Where are you going? Give me a ride.

683
38:58.025 --> 39:00.585
-We're not going the same way. -Don't use me and toss me aside.

684
39:00.665 --> 39:02.145
We'll work together in the future.

685
39:02.225 --> 39:04.745
Those two surveys Lin Long left behind are now on my plate.

686
39:04.825 --> 39:06.665
Let me know when you get there tomorrow morning.

687
39:06.745 --> 39:07.705
Okay.
